# Field-test logs. NEVER COMMITTED, and this repo is public.
#
# An exported diagnostic log carries speech captured in the cabin including
# anyone else present, Bluetooth device labels (which routinely contain a
# person's name -- "TOYOTA Corolla" is the polite case), the phone's OS and
# browser version, profile names with their rules, stakes and bankroll, and
# timestamps showing when and for how long the device was being driven.
#
# The whole directory is ignored rather than a glob, so a log saved under any
# name is covered.
field-logs/
